<title>USA: CCC buys 16,100 tonnes U.S. SRW wheat for Iraq.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 16,100 tonnes U.S. SRW wheat for Iraq.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said on Thursday it had purchased 16,100 tonnes of U.S. soft red winter wheat for export to Iraq.</p>
<p>The wheat was bought from Cargill Inc for $170.71 per tonne, FOB Baton Rouge.</p>
<p>Shipment was slated for December 5-30.</p>
<p>--Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720</p>
